{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51289","headline":"句 · 杜甫","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君看墙头桃树花，尽是行人眼中血。\n（《萤雪丛说》下卷）（宋曾季狸《艇斋诗话》引唐人诗云：「时人有酒送张八，惟我无酒送张八。\n君有陌上梅花红，尽是离人眼中血。\n」末二句与此仅数字不同。\n《唐诗纪事》卷三一收李约《赠韦况》有「明月照张八」之句，疑此诗亦李约作。\n《四库提要》谓《萤雪丛书》错误甚多，作杜诗恐不足爲据。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}